    unit_identifier_expression_statement_parse_error_2026-11-26, 0, "`fn f(unit: text) -> bool:` with body `unit == \"px\"` fails: parse error expected identifier, found Eq. `val r = unit == \"px\"` and `(unit == \"px\")` parse, so only a statement that starts with `unit` breaks. Short safe grammar must work (CLAUDE.md)."

